</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">projection_number</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of projections of the model to generate and fit to images. The lower the number, the faster the evaluation, but the lower the accuracy. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">reuse_direction</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Speed up evaluation by only periodically recalculating projections </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">n_components</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of the largest components to be considered for the EM image </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">micrographs_number</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of micrograph particles that were used to generate the class averages (or zero, the default, if unknown) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
